  "kind": "statement",
  "title": "Cohomology of a finite pushforward",
  "statement": "For a finite morphism $\\pi:Y\\to X_0$ and a torsion etale sheaf $\\mathcal F$ on $Y$,\n\n$$\nH^q(X_0,\\pi_*\\mathcal F)\\cong H^q(Y,\\mathcal F)\\qquad(q\\geq0).\n$$",
  "source": {
    "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-fourier-transform/sk-lem-as-properties/lem-fd-finite-pushforward-cohomology.md",
    "place": "node lem-fd-finite-pushforward-cohomology, order 2683"
  },
  "stmt_deps": [
    "def-fd-artin-schreier-sheaf"
  ],
  "proof": [
    {
      "text": "By [lemma-weil-pbc-finite-direct-image-exact] the functor $\\pi_*$ is exact and $R^q\\pi_*=0$ for $q>0$, so the Grothendieck spectral sequence of [lem-weil-pbc-grothendieck-spectral-sequence] for the composite $\\Gamma\\circ\\pi_*$ degenerates and computes the cohomology of $\\pi_*\\mathcal F$ as the cohomology of $\\mathcal F$; explicitly $H^q(X_0,\\pi_*\\mathcal F)=H^q(\\Gamma\\circ\\pi_*\\mathcal F)=H^q(\\Gamma_Y\\mathcal F)=H^q(Y,\\mathcal F)$.",
      "uses": [
        "lemma-weil-pbc-finite-direct-image-exact",
        "lem-weil-pbc-grothendieck-spectral-sequence"
      ],
      "elementary": false
    }
  ],
